#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_stock_expired_lot_guard
msgid ""
"\n"
"Expired Lot Guard\n"
"=================\n"
"\n"
"Odoo reserves the lot that expires first, which is the right order until the\n"
"lot is already expired: then it still reserves it, still lets the Barcode app\n"
"scan it, and only asks a yes/no question at validation. In a warehouse that\n"
"does not sell expired product, that question is answered by habit and the\n"
"product leaves.\n"
"\n"
"A flag on the operation type, *Block expired lots*, turns the guard on:\n"
"\n"
"* reservation skips lots whose expiration date has passed, even when no\n"
"  fresh lot is available (the line stays unreserved and visible);\n"
"* the Barcode app refuses a scanned expired lot with a red notice, and lets\n"
"  the operator replace the reserved lot by scanning another valid lot of the\n"
"  same product, without scanning the location first;\n"
"* validation refuses any line holding an expired lot.\n"
"\n"
"A customer who explicitly asks for expired product is served by recording an\n"
"approver on the transfer (group *Expired lot sale approver*) and a reason;\n"
"that transfer then behaves as stock Odoo does.\n"
msgstr ""

